Debug mode on a directory prints every file under it, the nested `nested/middle.md` included, sorted by path rather than creation order, with a blank line between files.
== args
--debug
input/pkg
== file input/pkg/z-last.md
# zLast
== file input/pkg/a-first.md
# aFirst
== file input/pkg/nested/middle.md
# middle
== stdout
\x1b[32m# aFirst\x1b[0m

\x1b[32m# middle\x1b[0m

\x1b[32m# zLast\x1b[0m
== stderr
== exit 0
